              "text": "મૂછ (mūch) comes from mucchā, \"mustache\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 10180). CDIAL asks whether it blends gocchā, \"furrow of the upper lip\", with mukha, \"mouth\", or comes through Middle Indo-Aryan from Sanskrit śmaśru, \"beard\"."
